    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 2,
      "title": "What is a semaphore?",
      "images": 8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "What is a semaphore?",
          "kind": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "para_break": true,
          "top": 0.123,
          "bottom": 0.214,
          "x0": 196.9,
          "cw": 19.9
        },
        {
          "text": "• Synchronization primitive like condition variables",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.22,
          "bottom": 0.281,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "• Semaphore is a variable with an underlying counter",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.278,
          "bottom": 0.339,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "• Two functions on a semaphore variable",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.336,
          "bottom": 0.397,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "– Up/post increments the counter",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.395,
          "bottom": 0.449,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "– Down/wait decrements the counter and blocks the calling",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.446,
          "bottom": 0.501,
          "x0": 115.2,
          "cw": 13.34
        },
        {
          "text": "thread if the resulting value is negative",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.493,
          "bottom": 0.543,
          "x0": 137.8,
          "cw": 9.19
        },
        {
          "text": "• A semaphore with init value 1 acts as a simple lock",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.541,
          "bottom": 0.602,
          "x0": 79.2,
          "cw": 9.45
        },
        {
          "text": "(binary semaphore = mutex)",
          "kind": "text",
          "level": 0,
          "para_break": false,
          "top": 0.593,
          "bottom": 0.649,
          "x0": 106.2,
          "cw": 11.91
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 3,
      "title": "Semaphores for ordering",
      "images": 8,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Semaphores for ordering",
          "kind": "heading",
